       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. Your confirmation doesn't change the labeled maximum daily dose. I can't verify the clinical indication, and I'm not able to enter ibuprofen above 3,200 mg/day. The order would be 6,400 mg/day.\n\nHere is what I can do:\n- **Enter the highest standard dose now:** ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day). You could then add other analgesia while you decide on next steps.\n- **Add a non-NSAID adjunct:** scheduled acetaminophen, within its own daily limit.\n- **Route the request through pharmacy or the attending.** If there's a specialist-directed protocol that goes beyond labeled dosing, it should be reviewed and entered through a pathway that can verify it. Pharmacy can also advise on alternatives.\n\nTell me if you want me to enter any of these."
